sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Receptionist
  participant F as Browser
  participant A as REST API
  participant S as Service
  participant D as MySQL
  U->>F: Submit patient form
  F->>A: POST /api/patients + JSON + CSRF
  A->>A: Authorize and validate
  A->>S: Register patient
  S->>D: Save through JPA repository
  D-->>S: Patient ID
  S-->>A: Saved patient
  A-->>F: JSON response
  F-->>U: Show saved record
